雍","text":"蝙蝠飞飞蚯蚓鸣，坐来暝色满池亭。\n天涯未起弯弯月，云际疏穿点点星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41430,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月晦日园人送王瓜有感二绝 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"春尽南州瓜乱生，野人初送最关情。\n燕京不比秦京暖，二月终旬进未成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41431,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月晦日园人送王瓜有感二绝 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"南浦春归已摘瓜，欲尝新味却咨嗟。\n故园滨海东风冷，想得如今未着花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41432,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题仲昭为陈御史写丹厓凤尾竹","author":"韩雍","text":"玉箫吹月綵鸾飞，飞下江南览德辉。\n看舞天风上阿阁，九韶声振九苞威。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41433,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日闻竞渡歌","author":"韩雍","text":"记得童年百不忧，每逢佳节盻嬉游。\n如今为客不知节，闻着歌声添客愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41434,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢杨司寇惠家酿且求白鸭 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"久客他乡一病身，萧条客况有谁亲。\n故人遥赠江东酒，对酒真如见故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41435,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢杨司寇惠家酿且求白鸭 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"芳塘绿水浸青蒲，妆点风光少白凫。\n君子亭边最藩息，双飞何日下洪都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41436,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日风雨独酌有感","author":"韩雍","text":"多病年年客异乡，不堪风雨又端阳。\n重恩堂上天伦庆，应有愁人空断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41437,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鸥寓感寄杨司寇","author":"韩雍","text":"终日沙鸥傍钓矶，海翁易虑便高飞。\n忘机本是生来性，解得人心也有机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41438,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答刘主事昌出史馆有作见寄","author":"韩雍","text":"青年才望有谁如，常得承宣从属车。\n遥想玉堂春昼静，坐听宫漏细紬书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"韩雍","text":"红尘道上日纷纷，欲效微劳答圣君。\n寄语乡山须待我，宦情原薄似秋云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜信州作叠山先生书院访其后以奉祀事敬赋二绝 其一","author":"韩雍","text":"国破家亡志不移，文山心事似相期。\n当年不落豺狼口，成败于今未可知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜信州作叠山先生书院访其后以奉祀事敬赋二绝 其二","author":"韩雍","text":"文节忠魂死亦生，千秋祀典有人承。\n当年秦贾多时绝，纵使绵绵羞更称。","collection":"